{"channelId":"UC6xKR_uwZA6XTy3kLIztC3w","row":["CROW Clinic",1980,"The Clinic for the Rehabilitation of Wildlife (CROW), is a teaching hospital and visitor center located in Sanibel Island, Florida. We are dedicated to saving wildlife through state-of-the-art veterinary care, research, education, and conservation medicine.  \n\nThe organization’s primary mission is the rescue, care, rehabilitation and eventual release of sick, injured and orphaned wildlife. Inherent in this mission is the education of adults and children, encouraging them to live a peaceful coexistence with their wild neighbors.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6xKR_uwZA6XTy3kLIztC3w","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6xKR_uwZA6XTy3kLIztC3w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:40.610Z","channelId":"UC6xKR_uwZA6XTy3kLIztC3w","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"786fc68b3f33c61e05ae1f38f9992791be7e036268034df4e191529a59997c0c","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"e146d258f345ea2c840252cab97acf843bfa8c7fe853609f2c2595c1a78c61d7"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6xKR_uwZA6XTy3kLIztC3w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:40.610Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6xKR_uwZA6XTy3kLIztC3w","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1980,"raw":"1.98K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6xKR_uwZA6XTy3kLIztC3w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:40.610Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["veterinary"],"relevantKeywords":["veterinary"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ywibtQISWeI"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集原文一致，命中本人／团队／服务语境；职业资质仍未核验。","keywords":["veterinary"],"role":"undetermined",